Pluvialis apricaria\"), \"Podiceps cristatus cristatus\", \"Podiceps grisegena grisegena\", creste\u021b pestri\u021b (\"Porzana porzana\"), \"Rallus aquaticus aquaticus\", l\u0103stun de mal (\"Riparia riparia\"), m\u0103r\u0103cinar (\"Saxicola rubetra\"), sitar de p\u0103dure (\"Scolopax rusticola\"), chir\u0103 de balt\u0103 (\"Sterna hirundo\"), silvie porumbac\u0103 (\"Sylvia nisoria\"), \"Tachybaptus ruficollis ruficollis\", fluierar negru (\"Tringa erythropus\"), fluierar de mla\u0219tin\u0103 (\"Tringa glareola\"), fluierar cu picioare verzi (\"Tringa nebularia\"), fluierarul cu picioare ro\u0219ii (\"Tringa totanus\"), pup\u0103z\u0103 (\"Upupa epops\"), nag\u00e2\u021b (\"Vanellus vanellus\")."}
{"id": "3114896", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3114896", "title": "Mittlere Havelniederung", "text": "Mittlere Havelniederung este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Germania \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului Mittlere Havelniederung este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul Mittlere Havelniederung a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 112 specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunea continental\u0103, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (112): l\u0103car-de-lac (\"Acrocephalus scirpaceus\"), fluierar de munte (\"Actitis hypoleucos\"), minuni\u021ba (\"Aegolius funereus\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 albastru (\"Alcedo atthis\"), ra\u021b\u0103 suli\u021bar (\"Anas acuta\"), ra\u021b\u0103 lingurar (\"Anas clypeata\"), ra\u021b\u0103 mic\u0103 (\"Anas crecca crecca\"), ra\u021b\u0103 fluier\u0103toare (\"Anas penelope\"), \"Anas platyrhynchos platyrhynchos\", ra\u021b\u0103 c\u00e2r\u00e2itoare (\"Anas querquedula\"), \"Anas strepera strepera\", \"Anser albifrons albifrons\", g\u00e2sc\u0103 cenu\u0219ie (\"Anser anser\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 cu cioc scurt (\"Anser brachyrhynchus\"), g\u00e2rli\u021b\u0103 mic\u0103 (\"Anser erythropus\"), \"Anser fabalis fabalis\", \"Anser fabalis rossicus\", f\u00e2s\u0103-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Anthus campestris\"), \"Ardea cinerea cinerea\", ciuf de c\u00e2mp (\"Asio flammeus\"), ra\u021b\u0103-cu-cap-castaniu (\"Aythya ferina\"), ra\u021ba mo\u021bat\u0103 (\"Aythya fuligula\"), \"Aythya marila\", ra\u021b\u0103 ro\u0219ie (\"Aythya nyroca\"), buhai de balt\u0103 (\"Botaurus stellaris stellaris\"), \"Branta bernicla bernicla\", \"Branta leucopsis\", g\u00e2sca cu piept ro\u0219u (\"Br